sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sekvencijalni dijagram - Registracija korisnika

    actor Korisnik
    participant SignUpDialog as Angular<br/>SignUpDialog
    participant AuthService
    participant DjangoAPI as Django API
    participant MariaDB

    Korisnik->>SignUpDialog: Klik na "Sign up"
    activate SignUpDialog
    SignUpDialog->>SignUpDialog: Prikazuje stepper formu<br/>(Korak 1: Podaci korisnika)
    Korisnik->>SignUpDialog: Unosi podatke<br/>(username, email, password)
    Korisnik->>SignUpDialog: Bira tip naloga<br/>(Običan korisnik / Firma)

    alt Firma (Dealership)
        SignUpDialog->>SignUpDialog: Prikazuje Korak 2:<br/>Podaci firme (PIB, adresa, telefon, logo)
        Korisnik->>SignUpDialog: Unosi podatke firme
        SignUpDialog->>SignUpDialog: Validira PIB (8 cifara)
        SignUpDialog->>AuthService: registerCompany(company, logoFile)
        activate AuthService
        AuthService->>DjangoAPI: POST /api/company/<br/>[multipart: PIB, address, phone, logo]
        activate DjangoAPI
        DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: INSERT INTO company
        activate MariaDB
        MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: OK
        deactivate MariaDB
        DjangoAPI->>DjangoAPI: Čuva logo fajl na disk
        DjangoAPI-->>AuthService: 200 OK (company data)
        deactivate DjangoAPI
        AuthService-->>SignUpDialog: company data saved
        deactivate AuthService
    end

    SignUpDialog->>SignUpDialog: Prikazuje Korak 3:<br/>Pregled podataka
    Korisnik->>SignUpDialog: Potvrđuje registraciju
    SignUpDialog->>AuthService: registerUser(user)
    activate AuthService
    AuthService->>DjangoAPI: POST /api/auth/create/<br/>[multipart: username, email, password, PIB, is_reseller]
    activate DjangoAPI
    DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM user<br/>WHERE is_superuser = 1
    activate MariaDB
    MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: admin_exists = true/false
    deactivate MariaDB
    DjangoAPI->>DjangoAPI: Ako admin ne postoji:<br/>is_superuser = true, is_staff = true
    DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: INSERT INTO user<br/>(set_password za hash)
    activate MariaDB
    MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: OK
    deactivate MariaDB
    DjangoAPI-->>AuthService: 200 OK (user data)
    deactivate DjangoAPI
    AuthService-->>SignUpDialog: true
    deactivate AuthService
    
    SignUpDialog->>Korisnik: Prikazuje poruku:<br/>"Registracija uspešna!"
    SignUpDialog->>SignUpDialog: Otvara Login dijalog
    deactivate SignUpDialog